{"id":"bc733aae908d1c17","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Terminal Front","display":"df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front — ZFC Tree11 Terminal Front","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front — ZFC Tree11 Terminal Front","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front — ZFC Tree11 Terminal Front"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"effa1ad98ab2c8a4\" href=\"?note=effa1ad98ab2c8a4\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a9ed3d666bd4979\" href=\"?note=2a9ed3d666bd4979\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,T\\in V\">\\(F,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S\\)</span> is the front predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2a9ed3d666bd4979\" href=\"?note=2a9ed3d666bd4979\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TerminalNode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TerminalNode}_S\\)</span> is the terminal-node predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"effa1ad98ab2c8a4\" href=\"?note=effa1ad98ab2c8a4\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TerminalFront}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TerminalFront}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}terminal\\text{-}front} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11TerminalFront}_S(F,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S(F,T)\\land\\forall t\\in F\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TerminalNode}_S(t,T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}terminal\\text{-}front} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11TerminalFront}_S(F,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S(F,T)\\land\\forall t\\in F\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TerminalNode}_S(t,T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A terminal front is a genuine front all of whose members satisfy the canonical terminal-node predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md","status":"resolved","id":"effa1ad98ab2c8a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a9ed3d666bd4979","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a9ed3d666bd4979","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S$ is the front predicate (see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree10-front-in-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md","status":"resolved","id":"effa1ad98ab2c8a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TerminalNode}_S$ is the terminal-node predicate (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree10-terminal-node.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TerminalNode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TerminalFront}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}terminal\\text{-}front} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11TerminalFront}_S(F,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree10FrontInTree}_S(F,T)\\land\\forall t\\in F\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TerminalNode}_S(t,T)","display":true}],"bytes":1119,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3803","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-terminal-front]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","effa1ad98ab2c8a4","2a9ed3d666bd4979"]}